  triage:closureNote "Verified fixed in 61df5fef5 (fix(http-runtime): classify load shedding accurately). Current crates/atm-http-runtime/src/message_handler.rs:193-197 uses AtmError::daemon_connection_saturated with explicit in-flight-capacity recovery text. just test and just lint pass on the merged branch." ;
